Subject: [PATCH 2/6] fix(web): fit the canvas to the host element, not the
 window

The fit and real scalings measured the space available from the wrapper to
the window's bottom-right corner, which assumes the component reaches the
window's edges. Embedded in anything smaller (a split pane, a sidebar), the
canvas was sized past the host's edges and got cropped.

Measure to the host element's box instead (falling back to the window while
the host has no size). The full scaling still uses the window.
